<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Akurumi NT</book>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakubu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ncaza me Yakubu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ncaza me</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakubu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Ame nre Yakubu biriyare bo Ashini ne Mbaa Yeso Animasihu, ᐩn-yane ncaza maye niya ke, ataa nikuri ne nriya hayen sa ᐩagatarezo ne unaafase wo inang, ˃nyankiza-ye.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Une wo iruwa ne uyiyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Aruwanke ham, kuwede uje uriyare sa ᐩuciye-ye, kuttin una apuwa ha amane gay, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />wərike iriya uriyare wo udonkize wo une wo iruwa yee, uwooze ureete. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Wərike nongo, sa ireete une wo iruwa ke Ashini niya umuwene, ita ihaaranko, a ingmaa, iza idere-ye ananke apuwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Ka bigi ne aməmo haye ᐩudira uyiyama, sa uyane nriribina ke Ashini sa awo ꞊uniyaze kuwede ana shere utpyabke, Ashini uta une-wo. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ka uyiyasa, sa une iruwa, kate uciye iruwa tiriya, wərike bore iriwa tiriya, ure saa nwuwamaw me uraawa sa uway ꞊ukutam nna shee, a utam nna shina. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Bigana been, kate ucay iruwa uta uciye ananke apuwa ke Mbaa, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />wo, a bigana bore iruwa iriya, kuwede yina sa ꞊uyane, iruwa yewo izaw ne ayaara nidii.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Hare udafe wo Ashini sa are hare ugbangane, sa ayane amane, wərike Ashini ᐩunyante-ha. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Haremay sa are hare apuwa ha taare, sa ayane amane wərike Ashini ᐩutuuti-ha daa. Wərike hare apuwa ha taare, ata anaa saa nrərife me ndare. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Ka uweng ᐩukaana ne nware, ꞊ukuwone mptya a ngbyatariko, sa nrərife ma nwaksa daa, sa unoo wo nna ncaano. Anongo hare apuwa ha taare, ata anaa are ne aməmo unaase.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Haremay sa ᐩareete une wo iruwa ke Ashini ne aməmo uriyare, ata are hare apuwa anowa, wərike ka areete niya umuwene, Ashini uta une-ha uray wee sa unumuwesize-wo, wee sa Ashini ᐩukuna uta une hare uyeme woo.<verse eid="JAS 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Ka apuwa sa ꞊akanaase awone bigana uyane wo araa ᐩaciye bigi, kate ukone Ashini ᐩuwuna-wo ne, wərike Ashini uza unaase-wo uwone bigi uyane wo araa, anongo azaa anaase-ha awone-wo uyane wo araa. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Bigana ꞊ukunugi ne apuwa sa akanaase awone bigana uyane wo araa, wərike umuwerəy wo iruwa yewo ᐩuriyanga-wo ukiyere-wo. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ka umuwerəy ᐩuyane itume, uta uwuri apuwa araa, ka apuwa araa ᐩamənenku, ata aye ne ungməne.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Aruwanke ham, kate ijese ariyange-ye. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Kuwede uje upase unoo, ake Ashini ᐩudin, awo ᐩuyane uweng ne upiye ne unaafase wo iwere. Wo, ure tantaasa ure, unuhansare-wo saa uwurigine. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />ᐩUyeme ᐩuwure haro, ne uwunda wo kiwenden ke anaza hawo, wərike ticiye unyante wee sa umaane kuwede yina sa ᐩuyane.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Uyane wo apuwa sa bogofe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Aruwanke ham, yiyaman haye, sa ire hare ugofe wo anaza yare, haza hare uyane wo anaza yare, haza hare ukara yare, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />wərike ukara wo bigana, uza uyane wo anowa sa Ashini utare. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Wərike nongo, sa ijese ꞊uyane wo ꞊ucugi wo apuwa araaa ha iziri ne hay sa anaziba-ha, sa are kuwede tiya, a irakte aciye haye, ikpaa anaza hawo sa ᐩuvina ne aməmo iruwa yee, sa ata ayane-ye nivuwange.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Wərike nongo, kate icuge hare ꞊ugofe wo anaza ha Ashini cas ire ne ꞊uriyanga wo aciye haye, yanen apuwa sa ꞊agose. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Awaasa ꞊ugofe anaza ha Ashini cas, amma ꞊unuyane-wo apuwa sa ꞊agose, ure saa awaasa ꞊ukugbənse nyano mawo ne ngəəni, <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />ka ᐩumuwene uyatew, sa umaa udore-wo, daabano, sa ushame-wo tantaasa ure. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ama awaasa ꞊ugbənse anaza ha Ashini ha kiwenden, hay sa a ana ꞊aniyaze nivuwange, ᐩureete uyane wo apuwa sa ᐩakuna, udaake ushama-wo ne apuwa sa ugofe, ata ayane-wo apuwa anowa ne unaafase wo apuwa sa ꞊uyane.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Awaasa ꞊ucuwana niciye newo wo a bore ꞊udafe wo Ashini nnoo, ama uza uyiyame-wo upiti wo unuwe woo, a niciye newo ꞊uriyange, udafe wo Ashini hawo a mbenne. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Udafe wo Ashini wee sa Ashini Babba wooro ꞊ukukpaa wo nsano ne uzira wo araa, a wee sa ꞊akande awoone haremay sa are ne uriyare, ne ahay sa anome haa angməne sa are ne aməmo uriyare, a bigana ukatte niciye newo ne uyane wo apuwa ha inang sa ata acaane-wo ne.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="ms">Uduwama ne ashini ha upere wo uyeme wo bigi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Aruwanke ham, hare une wo iruwa ke Yeso Animasihu bore upere, kate idonkeze a bigi umaane bigi. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Akone a bigi sa ᐩuwuna bicita bo azinariya ne mpoppuwa nnooma, ᐩuye ne aməmo usonde wo-ye, bigi bore ugbangane sa uwoone mpoppuwa nraama, womaa ᐩuye. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Ka idonke uyeme wo bore mpoppuwa nnoomma, ine-wo aninke ha ucugi anowa, hane ᐩikunanke bore ugbanganew, &lt;&lt;tunna bano,&gt;&gt; baa &lt;&lt;cuge daa baaze ubusa kom,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />ne uyate wo-ye, idaake ᐩidonke a bigi upere bigi ne aməmo haye, sa ᐩihara agana ne aməmo ndunkinze me apuwa araa sa are ne aməmo iruwa yee?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Aruwanke ham, rengken ato a igofe, haza Ashini uzangneke hare ugbangane ne inang, are hare apuwa ha taare ne aməmo une wo iruwa, a aciye tigbama tee sa ᐩayane haremay sa ayeme-wo, nikəwəri? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ama ᐩiyasa hare ugbangane. Haza a hare apuwa ha taare ꞊akangance-ye? Haza aha ꞊akəri-ye niya ne ugaamo? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Haza a ha ꞊anaze apuwa araa ne ashini ha niziya ninoono ne Animasihu, sa ariya-ye ne?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ka ꞊idafe uduwaka umənu wo anaza ha Ashini sa ꞊agose, &lt;&lt;Yeme biruwanke bobo saa niciye nebo,&gt;&gt; ꞊iyane apuwa anowa. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ama ka ꞊idonkeze a bigi upere bigi ꞊iyane araa, ᐩipura uduwaka, adonke uduwaka ukpate-ye ne. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Awaasa ꞊udafe unaafase wo apuwa sa uduwaka ꞊ugose, ama ukəre-wo udafe wo apuwa adii ne aməmo, ᐩadonke upura unaafase wo uduwaka. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ashini sa ᐩukuna, &lt;&lt;Kate bomare ne buray baa bonome bo bigi,&gt;&gt; awo ukuri ᐩukuna, &lt;&lt;Kate boyane nwono.&gt;&gt; Ka bodaake ᐩbomara ne buray, baa bonome bo bigi, ama ᐩboyane nwono, ᐩbocuge bore upusa wo uduwaka.<verse eid="JAS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Sa anaza haye ne apuwa sa ꞊iyane are saa aganaa sa ariya a ata ayane-ha nhara me anowa ne araa ne aməmo uduwaka wee sa uniyaze nivuwange. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Wərike kuwede ana sa unugofe-wo ugbane wo haage, ata awone-wo araa, shere ugofe wo ugbane. Ama ugofe wo ugbane, umaane uwuna wo bigi araa.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Une wo iruwa ne uyane wo tituma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Aruwanke ham, ayina are unoo wo ana ka bigana ꞊ugose a uciye une wo iruwa, ama uniyane-wo nituma ne une wo iruway? Une wo iruwa yewo uta utobse-wo? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Akone a biruwanke binome baa buray uza-wo mpoppuwa ne apuniya. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Ka bigi ne aməmo haye ukunan ke-wo, &lt;&lt;Duura ne aməmo nsano me iruwa, Ashini une-bo mpoppuwa ne apuniya,&gt;&gt; ama udaake ᐩuyane ananke apuwa wərike ukande wo nipum newo, ayina are unoo wo ana? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Anongo, une wo iruwa cas, shere uyane wo nituma a mbenne.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Ama bigi uta ukone, &lt;&lt;Bo bociye une wo iruwa, me ꞊n-yane nituma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 2:18">Nta nkone, ataana ta boyiyame a bodonke-m une wo iruwa yebo shere uyane wo nituma? Me nta ndonke-bo une wo iruwa-yom, ne aməmo uyane wo nituma nom. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />꞊Boniyaze iruwa Ashini a nidii, ayane unoo! Agbyarigare hamaa ᐩane iruwa, ama ꞊akacere wərike uwuwage.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Bo bore tirariga, sa akate adonke-bo a une wo iruwa shere uyane wo nituma a nituma ne mbenne? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />˂Akadaake akutti caara booro Ibirahem bore uyane wo anowa, wərike ˂ukune vana bewo Ishaku ne aninka ha uniyaze wo Ashini apuwa? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Inay une wo iruwa yewo ne apuwa sa ˂ukuyane, ˂akadaake ᐩahazano tiriya, une wo iruwa yewo ingmaa wərike apuwa sa ˂ukuyane. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />ᐩAngmaska anaza ha Ashini sa ꞊agose, &lt;&lt;Ibirahem ˂ukune iruwa ke Ashini, hane ᐩakutti-wo a bore uyane wo anowa,&gt;&gt; hane ꞊agaase-wo a suga wo Ashini.<verse eid="JAS 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Inay ꞊akakutti bigana a bore uyane wo anowa, wərike apuwa sa ꞊uyane, haza a wərike une wo iruwa cas.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Akadaake akutti Rahab bore ticinaake, a bore uyane wo anowa, wərike apuwa sa ˂ukuyane hare urənge wo apiye, sa ˂ukune-ha aninka ha nimare, hane ᐩukatte-ha ne unanke uwunda muwa? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Yantaasa nipum a ningməninenu, ka niza-wo bidiri, anongo une wo iruwa shere nituma, a ungməninew.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Uduwama ne ashini ha niniyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Aruwanke ham, kate agana gay ne aməmo haye are hare udonkize, wərike iriya haro sa tire hare udonkize, Ashini uta uyane haro nhara me anowa ne araa gay sa mmaane me agana. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Unaafase wooro ꞊tiyane apuwa sa azaa didəy ne tiwunda muwa muwa. Awaasa ᐩuyiyama udafe ne niniyam newo ne aməmo apuwa sa ꞊unaze, wo a bore uzira wo araa sa uta uyiyame udafe ne unaafase wo nipum newo.<verse eid="JAS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Ka tiwuna niwiya ne inime ye bara, wərike tidafe ne wo, tatiyiyame tihansare unaafase wo ne nipum newo. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Gbənken saa njirigi me nwuwamaw, ne unaate wo nna, uway ugasoo ꞊ukuhansare nna, nongo yaaro, a ne kizume kicimka bore ukərew ꞊ukuhansare una niya tiya sa utare ne. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />A nongo niniyam nire, naa ninay cim, ama ꞊nibuwerinze ne anaza amənsuha. Gbənken ucimi wo nicenke ne nishiyana, una wo nina ꞊ukupabe ndare nmənuma. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Niniyam duki a saa una nire, ane aməmo nina, ꞊acesize kuwede aje apuwa araa ne, ne aməmo unaafase wo akpara ha nipum, anina ꞊nicaane unaafase wo bigana ne, ꞊niwooze unaafase wo ucugi wo bigana ne aməmo una, nina, a ukura wo una ꞊unose nina.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Bigana ˂ukuyiyame udafe ne unaafase wo inama ye ndare, ne anii, ne yee sa ꞊ikəri nipum daa, a ye nwuwamaw, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />ama azaa awaasa uta uyiyame udafe ne niniyam. Niniyam a apuwa araa sa nnivankanze-wo, ningmaa ne udəfi uraaw.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />A nina ꞊tirumi Mbaa Babba wooro ne, a ꞊tiware agana unuwe ne, haremay sa Ashini ᐩuyane-ha saa wo. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Ane unuwe udiin-wo ꞊arumi Ashini a ꞊ayane tizuwaga ne. Aruwanke ham, nongo adaake ayane unoo. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Uwuwe wo nwuwamaw uta uyiyame ukatte nwuwamaw nniyamtoma ne may sa nkaraa? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Aruwanke ham, uti wo ugba, uta uyiyame a uwuri ayiyane ha uzaitun? Baa uti wo inəbi uta uyiyame a uwuri ayiyane ha uti wo ugba? Anongo, uwuwe wo nwuwamaw nkarama, uza ukatte-wo nwuwamaw nniyamtoma.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uyiyama sa ᐩudi ashini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ne aməmo haye a ana uciye uyiyama ne uriya? Sa udonke ne aməmo ucugi woo unoo sa uyane ne aməmo uratte wo niciye, sa uyiyama ꞊uwooze. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Ama ka iruwa yee, ingmaa ne niyaro gay, a uyeme wo iruwa, kate itame bikpaga, a igaa-ye kiwenden. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Uyiyama ween haza ashini udin, ama a wo inang yee, ne uyeme wo aciye, a wo bigbama bo agbyarigare. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Kitiyasa niyaro a uyeme wo iruwa ure ne, bano ꞊acesize tikara, ne unaafase wo apuwa araa.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ama uyiyama wee sa ᐩudi ashini, usano. Uniyaze ucugi wo uniyamto ne aciye, ne uratte wo niciye, a uyane wo apuwa sa atare, ne ugofe wo ugbane gay, a uyane wo anowa, unuyane-wo nzawa, uyane kiwenden. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Hare ꞊uwuuza wo agana ayane ucugi wo uniyamto ne aciye, a saa igbaaro ꞊avene, yee sa iyiyezi ne uyane wo anowa.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="ms">Nen aciye haye ke Ashini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Ayina ayiyezi ne tiduba a tikara ne aməmo haye? Haza a wərike umuwerəy wo-ye sa ure ne ngmassa ne iruwa yee? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Itare ananke apuwa, idaake iciye. ꞊Iwekse haage wərike itare apuwa haa, idaake iciye apuwa sa itare. ꞊Iyane tikara ne tiduba, idaake iciye apuwa sa itare wərike idaake iyiyasa Ashini. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Ka iyiyasa, ꞊inicisize-ye wərike ꞊iyasize ne iruwa iraay. Itare inaate apuwa sa ᐩiciye ne ugofe wo uniyamto wo aciye haye.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Ye hare uzira wo kiwenden, itiya-ye nisuga ne inang a ugaa wo Ashini? Awaasa ᐩuzangneke uyane wo nisuga ne inang yee wo a bore ugaa wo unay wo Ashini. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Baa ꞊iyate a mbenne apuwa sa ncaza me anaza ha Ashini ꞊ngose, Bidiri bee sa Ashini ᐩuwuna ne aməmo iruwa yooro utare ucuge ne haro? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Ama Ashini awo ꞊uniyaze haro apuwa anowa gay. A ana ᐩawuna ncaza me anaza ha Ashini ꞊ngose:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">&lt;&lt;Ashini ꞊ugaaza-wo bore unyante wo niciye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">ama ꞊uyanze bore uratte wo niciye apuwa anowa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Nen aciye haye ke Ashini, a igaa-ye bigbama bo agbyarigare, uta ucome-ye. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Yen n-yaa ke Ashini, wo uta uye n-yaa keye. Rundan tiyante-ye, ye hare uyane wo apuwa araa. Ptyizen iruwa yee ye hare iruwa iriya. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Yanen ncaanom me iruwa, shiyen, tuutizin n-yizi. Tizuwa tee tivoore asuwe, amane haye avoore ncaanom me iruwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Ratten aciye haye ubusa ke Mbaa, wo uta unyante-ye ashini.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Aruwanke ham, kate ine inama ye aruwanke haye. Awaasa ᐩuyane anaza araa ne ashini ha biruwanke bewo, baa ᐩuwooze-wo araa, adonke ꞊unaze uduwaka araa, a uyane una nhara me anowa ne araa. Awaasa ꞊uyane uduwaka nhara me anowa ne araa, unudafe-wo uduwakaw, ama ucuwana niciye newo upere ugaso wo uduwaka. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />A Ashini cas ure bore ꞊uniyaze wo uduwaka ne bore nhara me anowa ne araa, awo ᐩuhama utubse a uwe. Ama a bo bore ana, sa tabowone biruwanke bobo araa?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubuwərinze ne ashini ha nikate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Gofen, ye haremay sa ꞊igose, &lt;&lt;Yenəy baa nikate, tatiya ne ananke apiye, tatikoze niyaw, tiyane nzeno a ticiye ikurife.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Itiya-ye apuwa sa ata aye nikate. Ayina are uray wee? A saa umiya ure, tabonay una saanuwaw, ka boməru sa bonaase una boderen. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Uməy wo ikone, &lt;&lt;Ka Mbaa ukpaa, uyante haro ne, tatiyane hay ne hanaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ama ire ne ꞊ubuwərinze ne ꞊unyanteze wo aciye haye. Unaafase wo apuwa hayen apuwa araa. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Awaasa uriya apuwa anowa sa azibi uyane, hane udaake uyane ana, ᐩuyane apuwa araa.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="ms1">Uduwama wo hare apuwa ha taare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Hare apuwa ha taare, renken ato a igofe, yanen asuwe ne nkaaro wərike apuwa ha ncaanom me iruwa sa ata aciye-ye. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Apuwa ha taare teye sa iciye, ᐩacaano, biine ᐩuniya mpoppuwa maye. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Azinariya ne azurufa haye ᐩakafa nwura gay. Nwurama, a nna nta n-yane anaza ne ashini haye, nta mpabe apum haye saa una. ᐩIsunda aciye haye apuwa ha taare ne aməmo aye ha umanne. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ikurife ye haremay sa ꞊ayane nituma ne tiruge teye sa igaa-ye une woha, ire ne asuwe ne ashini haye. Asuwe ha haremay sa ꞊ayane-ye nituma ne usunda wo nigbaaro ne tiruge teye, ahama ne ato ha Mbaa Bigbama bo hare ntaa sa are ashini. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />ᐩIyane ucugi wo ugofe wo uniyamto ne amane ne inang yee. Tikuweneto sa ᐩiyane, ire saa binaa bee sa uya kiwaa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />ᐩIwuna hare uzira wo araa sa adaake ᐩagaa-ye, apuwa araa, ᐩiwekse-ha.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="ms1">Ureete ne aməmo uriyare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Aruwanke ham, sa irakte iruwa yee, niya agaba ha niziya ne Mbaa. Gbənken tantaasa bore avara ꞊ukuya niye ne beera bo bikpagba ne beera bo nikaane ne usanima, sa idaa ita ine nigbaaro. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Yemaa sa irakte iruwa yee, tantaasa hare avara ꞊ayane, yanen ugaso wo iruwa, Mbaa unuye n-yaa niziya.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Aruwanke ham, kate iyane nwuməru ne ntitay ma-ye wərike kate awone-ye araa. Gbənken a inay, bore nhara me anowa ne araa ˃utore ne anənkəy!<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Aruwanke ham, wərike iyiyame ureet ne aməmo uriyare, sa igbənke hare niyiyezi ne anaza ha Ashini sa ˂akayane anaza ne aməmo niziya ne Mbaa. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />꞊Tirumi haremay sa ˂akareete ne aməmo uriyare. Ita ibatiriza ureete wo Ayoba, ˃inay tantaasa ne umanne Mbaa ˂ukuyane-wo anowa. Mbaa ungmaa ne iruwa ye uyane wo anowa ne ugofe wo ugbane.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Aruwanke ham, apuwa sa apere kuwede yina anay, kate bigi utuna ne ananke apuwa sa are ashini ne ndaa baa ananke apuwa muwa. Tunnan ne anaza adii, ka anongo sa ikone anongo, ka haza anongo sa ikone haza anongo, wərike kate awone-ye araa.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Nriribina me une wo iruwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Baa bigi ne aməmo haye ure ne uniya wo uriyare? Sa uyane nriribina. Baa bigi ure ne amane? Sa uyane tiwune te urume wo Mbaa. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Baa bigi ne aməmo haye ukpana? Sa ᐩugaaseke harewono wo ukura wo hare udafe, aye ayane-wo nriribina, a asharige-wo mmay ne aməmo niziya ne Mbaa. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Nriribinama sa ᐩayane nna ne aməmo une wo iruwa, nta nwumza bore nkpane, Mbaa uta uninkizə-wo. Ka ᐩuyane araa, ata aviyase-wo ana. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Wərike nongo nyaana ꞊biyaren aciye haye apuwa araa sa ꞊iyane a iyane aciye haye nriribina wərike iwuma. Nriribina me bore uzira wo araa nciye ugaso wo uyane wo nituma nimənnu.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Iniya a bigana saa haro, sa ˂ukuyane nriribina gay, a kate aruwa beera, ˂akayane tinay tetaaro ne tipiye utase shere beera. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Sa ˂ukukuri ᐩuyane nriribina, nshini ᐩnne beera, idaa ikuri ᐩine nigbaaro.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Aruwanke ham, ka bigi ne aməmo haye, ujese uwunda wo kiwenden, sa bigi uziya newo ne uwunda. <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />Sa iyiyame, awaasa uvoore ne bore uyane wo apuwa araa ne uwunda, utubsa-wo ne aməmo ungməne, hayen ata are uwunda wo uviyasa wo apuwa araa gay.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>